<section id="faq" class="py-24 md:py-32"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1360px] px-5 sm:px-6 md:px-8 xl:px-10 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-32"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><div><p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ember"><span class="size-1.5 rotate-45 bg-ember" aria-hidden="true"></span>Common questions</p><h2 class="mt-5 max-w-[18ch] text-h2 font-semibold text-balance text-ink">Good to know first.</h2></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><div class="max-w-xl text-lead text-pretty text-slate">Something we didn&#x27;t cover? Send a text to <span class="font-mono text-ink">(555) 555-0148</span> and a technician will answer it.</div><div><a href="sms:5555550148" class="group/button relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,transform,translate,scale,rotate] duration-300 active:scale-[0.98] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-ink/15 text-ink hover:border-ink/40 hover:bg-ink/[0.03] h-12 gap-3 pl-5 pr-1.5 text-[15px]"><span class="relative block overflow-hidden py-0.5"><span class="block transition-transform duration-500 ease-expo group-hover/button:-translate-y-[115%]">Ask a technician by text</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 block translate-y-[115%] py-0.5 transition-transform duration-500 ease-expo group-hover/button:translate-y-0">Ask a technician by text</span></span><span class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full size-9 bg-ink text-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square-text size-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-expo group-hover/button:translate-x-[200%]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path><path d="M13 8H7"></path><path d="M17 12H7"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square-text absolute size-4 -translate-x-[200%] transition-transform duration-500 ease-expo group-hover/button:translate-x-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path><path d="M13 8H7"></path><path d="M17 12H7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-7"><div class="border-t border-ink/10"><div class="border-b border-ink/10"><h3><button id="_R_b3b6_-q-0" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="_R_b3b6_-a-0" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.2rem] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-ember sm:text-[1.4rem]">Is it safe to open the door with a broken spring?</span><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[background-color,border-color,color,transform,translate,scale,rotate] duration-500 ease-expo rotate-45 border-ink bg-ink text-cream" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_b3b6_-a-0" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_b3b6_-q-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-expo grid-rows-[1fr] opacity-100"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-slate">No. The spring carries the door&#x27;s weight, so without it the opener strains and the door can come down hard. If the door is closed, pull the red cord to disconnect the opener, leave the door shut and give us a call.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-ink/10"><h3><button id="_R_b3b6_-q-1" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_b3b6_-a-1" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.2rem] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-ember sm:text-[1.4rem]">Is there a call-out fee?</span><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[background-color,border-color,color,transform,translate,scale,rotate] duration-500 ease-expo border-ink/15 text-ink group-hover:border-ink/40" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_b3b6_-a-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_b3b6_-q-1" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-expo grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-slate">A $59 diagnostic fee applies, and it is waived when we carry out the repair. You&#x27;ll hear about it before we set off, never after.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-ink/10"><h3><button id="_R_b3b6_-q-2" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_b3b6_-a-2" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.2rem] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-ember sm:text-[1.4rem]">Only one spring broke. Why change both?</span><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[background-color,border-color,color,transform,translate,scale,rotate] duration-500 ease-expo border-ink/15 text-ink group-hover:border-ink/40" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_b3b6_-a-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_b3b6_-q-2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-expo grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-slate">The pair went in together and has done exactly the same number of cycles. The second one usually gives out within months, so replacing both saves you another visit.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-ink/10"><h3><button id="_R_b3b6_-q-3" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_b3b6_-a-3" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.2rem] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-ember sm:text-[1.4rem]">How long does a new door take from start to finish?</span><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[background-color,border-color,color,transform,translate,scale,rotate] duration-500 ease-expo border-ink/15 text-ink group-hover:border-ink/40" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_b3b6_-a-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_b3b6_-q-3" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-expo grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-slate">The measure takes around 20 minutes. Most doors arrive within 1–3 weeks, and fitting takes 4–6 hours including taking the old door away.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-ink/10"><h3><button id="_R_b3b6_-q-4" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_b3b6_-a-4" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.2rem] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-ember sm:text-[1.4rem]">Which opener brands can you repair?</span><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[background-color,border-color,color,transform,translate,scale,rotate] duration-500 ease-expo border-ink/15 text-ink group-hover:border-ink/40" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_b3b6_-a-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_b3b6_-q-4" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-expo grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-slate">Every major residential brand, older models included. If the parts for yours are no longer made, we&#x27;ll say so on the spot.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-ink/10"><h3><button id="_R_b3b6_-q-5" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_b3b6_-a-5" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-6 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.2rem] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-ember sm:text-[1.4rem]">Can you come out at the weekend?</span><span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-[background-color,border-color,color,transform,translate,scale,rotate] duration-500 ease-expo border-ink/15 text-ink group-hover:border-ink/40" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_b3b6_-a-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_b3b6_-q-5" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-expo grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-2xl pb-7 pr-14 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-slate">Yes, on Saturdays from 8 AM to 6 PM. The emergency line runs every day until 10 PM.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>
